<title>POLAND: BORYSZEW, GORAZDZE RATED &quot;BUY&quot;.</title>
<headline>BORYSZEW, GORAZDZE RATED &quot;BUY&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>ING Barings rated Polish chemical firm Boryszew SA and cement plant Gorazdze SA as &quot;buy&quot; in its report dated May 31.</p>
<p>&quot;Gorazdze is still cheap compared with most emerging markets cement producers,&quot; the report said. It called Gorazdze &quot;Poland's most cost-effient cement plant.&quot;</p>
<p>The report said Boryszew, Poland's main producer of anti-freeze liquid, enjoys a strong position on the higher-margin replacement car market.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
